# A `*` dependency matching an artifact migration is rewritten to the migrated coordinates when a visible BOM's
# new version pins them. A filtered run that doesn't bump the BOM leaves the `*` line untouched (the old
# coordinates are still pinned), while any run that bumps the BOM — filtered to it or not — migrates the line.

> myproject/updateDependencies org.old:

$ must-mirror project/dependencies.conf project/dependencies.conf.filtered.expected

> myproject/updateDependencies com.example:

$ must-mirror project/dependencies.conf project/dependencies.conf.expected

> myproject/updateDependencies

$ must-mirror project/dependencies.conf project/dependencies.conf.expected
